{"version":1,"content":"<p>剛剛，Google推出了Gemini 4 Hydrogen（氫），主打速度和執行效率<strong>。</strong>和前兩次「高端模型」的更新不同，<strong>Hydrogen直接向所有人開放</strong>。免費用户可以通過Gemini App的自動模型選擇使用它，付費用户則可以手動選擇。開發者也可以通過Google AI Studio和Gemini API使用。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586206.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:16:58.091685+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T05:56:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_hash":"19612696a322684d5870399fc9cf470d35b553c46cecdff6f2174845096da41c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}